@startuml sequence-gec-interaction-m23
title SEQ-10: Scenario Writing with GEC AI Service Interaction Flow (BF-14 / P1-FR-007)
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Learner" as Learner
boundary "Web Learner Client\n(SCR-L-13 Scenario View)" as Web
control "Next.js Route Handler\n(/api/ai/gec Proxy)" as Proxy
control "FastAPI AI Server\n(T5-small, Stateless)" as AIServer

== 1. Scenario Writing Submission ==
Learner -> Web: Enter free-form English sentence for scenario prompt (SCR-L-13)
activate Web
Web -> Proxy: POST /api/ai/gec {\n  text: rawInputText,\n  scenarioId: "scen-hotel-checkin"\n}\n(Authenticated via httpOnly Session Cookie)
activate Proxy

Proxy -> Proxy: Validate input syntax:\n- Text length <= 500 characters (P1-NFR-001)\n- Extract session JWT for Bearer authorization

alt Validation Failure (e.g. text > 500 chars)
    Proxy --> Web: 413 Payload Too Large {\n  error: { code: "TEXT_TOO_LONG", message: "Input exceeds 500 chars limit" }\n}
    Web --> Learner: Show inline validation warning
else Valid Input -> Dispatch to AI Server with 8.0s Timeout
    Proxy -> AIServer: POST /v1/gec/correct\nAuthorization: Bearer <user_jwt_from_session>\n{\n  "text": rawInputText,\n  "language": "en"\n}
    activate AIServer

    note right of AIServer
        Authoritative Invariant (ADR-014 / M2.3 §7):
        - AI Server is strictly STATELESS.
        - AI Server performs ZERO primary database access.
        - GEC output is TRANSIENT (never written to DB).
        - AI owns ZERO LearningProgress, ZERO Mastery,
          ZERO Proficiency, ZERO Streak, ZERO Completion.
        - Traced to BF-14 (ZERO fabricated UC).
    end note

    alt Success Case: Response within 8.0s Timeout
        AIServer -> AIServer: Run T5-small GEC model inference\nDerive structured edit spans
        AIServer --> Proxy: 200 OK (Example response) {\n  "corrected_text": "...",\n  "edits": [{ "start": 0, "end": 4, "replacement": "..." }],\n  "model_version": "t5-small-gec-v1",\n  "is_mock": <runtime/config-derived boolean, e.g. false>,\n  "latency_ms": <runtime-measured integer, e.g. 120>\n}
        deactivate AIServer

        Proxy --> Web: 200 OK (Example response) {\n  corrected_text, edits, model_version,\n  is_mock, latency_ms\n}
        Web --> Learner: Display visual sentence diff,\nhighlighted grammar corrections & feedback

    else Failure Case A: Latency Timeout (> 8.0s)
        Proxy -> Proxy: Hard timeout reached (8.0 seconds)
        Proxy --> Web: 504 Gateway Timeout {\n  error: { code: "DEPENDENCY_TIMEOUT", message: "AI response timed out" }\n}
        Web --> Learner: Display recoverable notice:\n"Phản hồi AI đang chậm, bạn vẫn có thể tiếp tục học bài khác."

    else Failure Case B: AI Server Unavailable (503 / Connection Refused)
        Proxy -> Proxy: Catch upstream 503 / Network Error
        Proxy --> Web: 503 Service Unavailable {\n  error: { code: "MODEL_UNAVAILABLE", message: "GEC service is currently down" }\n}
        deactivate Proxy
        Web --> Learner: Display graceful degraded UI:\n"Tính năng sửa lỗi tạm thời gián đoạn. Tiến độ học không bị ảnh hưởng."
    end
end
deactivate Web

@enduml
